<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia April palm oil exports 631,334t -Caleb.</title>
<headline>Malaysia April palm oil exports 631,334t -Caleb.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Caleb Brett put Malaysia's March bulk palm oil exports at 631,334 tonnes against its estimate of 620,004 for March, traders said.</p>
<p>The figures include laurics and oleochemicals but exclude shipments to Singapore and exports in drum, said the traders who obtained the data by facsimile.</p>
<p>The official Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority put March exports at 565,219 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-7510)</p>
</text>
